  "title": "Chocolate-Cherry-Coconut Granola Bars",
  "description": "Perfect for breakfast or a power snack, these chewy, no-bake granola bars are packed with chocolate chips, cherries, almonds, coconut, oats, and peanut butter.",
  "authors": [
